{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"toyota-production-system","title":"丰田精益生产 TPS","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/toyota-production-system","wordCount":1642,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"kaizen-culture","title":"丰田改善(Kaizen)文化","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/kaizen-culture","wordCount":1649,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"respect-for-people","title":"丰田\"尊重人\"原则","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/respect-for-people","wordCount":1758,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"toyota-way-philosophy","title":"丰田之道（Toyota Way）完整解析","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/toyota-way-philosophy","wordCount":2673,"readingTime":11},{"seq":5,"slug":"mission-vision-values","title":"丰田使命愿景价值观：从\"造车\"到\"量产幸福\"","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/mission-vision-values","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8},{"seq":6,"slug":"akio-toyoda-transformation","title":"丰田章男的改革：从汽车公司到移动出行公司","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/akio-toyoda-transformation","wordCount":2022,"readingTime":9},{"seq":7,"slug":"monozukuri-craftmanship","title":"ものづくり（制造精神）：日本匠人文化在现代制造的延续","url":"/h/corporate-management/toyota/culture-and-values/monozukuri-craftmanship","wordCount":2280,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# 文化与价值观 简介\n\n丰田之道的根基不在厂房设备，而在组织信奉并践行的价值观。本章从三个角度展开丰田的文化内核。\n\n**丰田精益生产 TPS** 阐述丰田生产方式的哲学起源——从消除七种浪费到实现\"一个流\"的理想状态，TPS不只是一套工具集，更是一种看待工作的世界观。\n\n**丰田改善(Kaizen)文化** 探讨丰田如何将\"今天比昨天好一点\"变成每一位员工的本能反应，从车间提案制度到管理层的改善巡回，改善是组织的呼吸节奏。\n\n**丰田\"尊重人\"原则** 解析Toyota Way双支柱中常被忽视的那一根——人不是流水线的延伸，而是改善的主体。团队合作、信任授权与长期承诺构成丰田人才观的三棱镜。\n"}